<title>UK: Melin steps down as Arjo director.</title>
<headline>Melin steps down as Arjo director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-French paper and packaging group Arjo Wiggins Appleton plc said on Monday that Daniel Melin had resigned as a director with immediate effect.</p>
<p>&quot;This follows the announcement on February 21 of the proposed merger between Worms &amp; Cie and Saint Louis,&quot; the company said in a statement, giving no further details.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
